close_reason: Delivered and verified the native crash-recoverable create contract; publication remains maintainer-gated.
body: This slice intentionally requires explicit IDs and supports the canonical built-in type folders first. Broader ID generation runtime schemas extensions and derived indexes remain separate follow-up slices so this transaction can be proven rather than widened prematurely.
